; @wagnerluca/ui is published to GitHub Packages by the design-system repo
; (WagnerLuca/wagnerluca-ui, .github/workflows/publish.yml, on v*.*.* tags).
;
; It is an optional dependency: without NODE_AUTH_TOKEN npm skips it and the build
; uses the bundled fallback tokens (vite.config.ts). With a token:
;   local dev  -> export NODE_AUTH_TOKEN=<classic PAT with read:packages>
;   CI         -> injected from secrets (see .github/workflows/ci-cd.yml)
;   Docker     -> passed in as a BuildKit secret, never as an ARG/ENV layer
@wagnerluca:registry=https://npm.pkg.github.com
//npm.pkg.github.com/:_authToken=${NODE_AUTH_TOKEN}
